        "evt_arc_imperial_court_contest"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "When formless hands later seize Ye Lui Sang’s Gu worms, Ye Lui Lai is again named as the lender of that fire path Immortal Gu, given to help Ye Lui Sang win the contest.",
